  "description": "Find out how high above sea level anywhere in the world is, with the free Open-Elevation service. Measure a single spot, a whole list of sites at once to see which is highest and lowest, or a route from end to end for its total climb, its steepest stretch and the shape of the ground along the way. Every height comes in both metres and feet, and every distance in kilometres and miles. No account or API key is required.",
  "display_name": "Open-Elevation",
  "id": "open_elevation"
